# Videos used to try the scripts by hand and what ends up next to them: the <name>_vhs.avi results and the
# transcodes and remuxes from TECHNICAL_GUIDE.md (*_vhs.mp4, *_vhs_hevc.mp4, *_vhs.mkv). The scripts keep their
# intermediate files in a private temporary folder outside the repository.
*.avi
*.mkv
*.mov
*.mp4
*.m4v
*.mpg
*.webm

# Working files of .github/workflows/release.yaml when its steps run locally: the generated test clips and their
# outputs (work/), the package staging and archives (stage/, release-assets/) and the tag list (tags.txt).
# The "VHSify: test" task in .vscode/tasks.json uses a temporary folder instead.
/work/
/stage/
/release-assets/
/tags.txt

# OS metadata on the three supported platforms. It also keeps strays out of site/: pages.yaml expects exactly
# six files there.
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
